# Wait for the satellite to leave the Earth's shadow
# Waits until the orbit the run follows puts the satellite in sunlight, for at
# most the minutes given. It ends at once if the satellite is in sunlight
# already. Choose the orbit first, with orbit follow or orbit replay.
block sunrise within <minutes:number 1..600 min>
load rOrbit

until InUmbra = false within {minutes} min
